

reagent-name-milkshake-strawberry = strawberry milkshake
reagent-desc-milkshake-strawberry = A tasty alternative to coffee and soda. Probably safe... A berry-powered boost with no hint of chemicals. Though who really knows for sure?

reagent-name-milkshake-cherry = cherry milkshake
reagent-desc-milkshake-cherry = A tasty alternative to coffee and soda. Probably safe... A sweet-and-sour balance that tingles on the tongue. As bright as a telecrystal just as suspicious.

reagent-name-milkshake-carrot = carrot milkshake
reagent-desc-milkshake-carrot = Specially crafted for health-conscious enthusiasts. Pure wellness in a glass. They say it even improves your eyesight. Or maybe that's just dizziness from feeling so virtuous.

reagent-name-milkshake-chocolate = chocolate milkshake
reagent-desc-milkshake-chocolate = A treat for lovers of that sweet touch of bitterness. The perfect companion for beach days or chocolate ice cream fans.

reagent-name-milkshake-banana = banana milkshake
reagent-desc-milkshake-banana = Shake line brought to you in partnership with Honk Inc., so everyone can enjoy the bold new flavor of the sacred clown fruit.

reagent-name-red-space-energy = energy drink "RedSpace Energy"
reagent-desc-red-space-energy = Redspace energy, straight from the can.

reagent-name-telestizin = telestizin
reagent-desc-telestizin = A unique compound found in telecrystals. Through extreme pressure and heat, it is refined into vestine.
reagent-name-telesynthet = telesynthet
reagent-desc-telesynthet = A specialized chemical cocktail crafted for thrill-seekers. Grants immense enhancements to whoever drinks it. Banned across most nations and corporations, right alongside the infamous Donk Co. stimulant.
reagent-name-bubblegum = bubblegum
reagent-desc-bubblegum = Just ordinary sweet chewing gum—can you blow a bubble?
reagent-name-bubblegum-chewed = bubblegum chewed
reagent-desc-bubblegum-chewed = A nasty piece of chewed gum it still smells of something sweet.
reagent-name-luciferium = luciferuim
reagent-desc-luciferium = An artificially created symbiotic agent that irreversibly alters the host's biology. Once it enters the body, it becomes a part of it, granting the organism superhuman endurance at the cost of eternal dependency. For Luciferium, there are no former hosts—only the living and the dead.
